{"seq":3,"slug":"evolving-review-and-gates","title":"演进评审与门禁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-assisted-code-review-quality/sustaining-quality-with-ai/evolving-review-and-gates","wordCount":1988,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"演进评审与门禁\">演进评审与门禁</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>质量门禁与评审流程是基础设施，而基础设施都会衰减：模型换代让旧校准失准，团队扩张让旧默契失效，门禁自身也会腐烂——flaky、误报、被熟练地绕开。一项横跨三个时代的大规模研究为这种衰减提供了定量注脚，也解释了为什么「一次设好、永久运行」的流程在 AI 时代注定脱节。把评审与门禁当作随反馈持续打磨的活系统，是质量保障长期有效的关键；本文讲清演进的必要性、驱动它的真实信号，以及在持续调整中不把系统越调越坏的方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>质量门禁与评审流程是基础设施，而基础设施都会衰减。本篇用<strong>校准债</strong>命名这种衰减：门禁参数是按某个时点的缺陷分布与工具能力标定的，模型换代、团队扩张、门禁自身腐烂都会让环境移动，债务逐月累积——平时不可见，兑现在逃逸事故上。识别校准债的线索往往先于事故出现，对应的两个可直接落地的度量是门禁逃逸率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>prod</mtext></msub><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>prod</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>caught</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e=\\frac{D_{\\text{prod}}}{D_{\\text{prod}}+D_{\\text{caught}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5395em;vertical-align:-0.5481em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9914em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prod</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">caught</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5131em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prod</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>（衡量拦截面质量）与 flaky 率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>flake</mtext></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>run</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f=\\frac{N_{\\text{flake}}}{N_{\\text{run}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3393em;vertical-align:-0.4451em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8942em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">run</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4159em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">flake</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4451em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>（衡量信度）。演进的方法论是<strong>小步、单点、带观察窗</strong>：一次只动一道门，留两周观察窗，确认指标方向后再继续——大爆炸式改革无法归因，也就无法学习。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么要演进\">为什么要演进</h2><p><strong>效率与质量的关系已经改变。</strong> 一篇 2026 年的研究分析了 207 个 GitHub 项目的约 102 万个经过评审的 PR，覆盖三代评审形态（human-centric 到 LLM-assisted 再到 agentic）：agent 参与的协作模式确实让评审决策更快，但论文明确指出这些效率增益<strong>并未转化为更好的评审质量</strong>（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.13196\">arXiv:2607.13196</a>）。如果你的门禁体系是在第一代形态下校准的，它的每一个参数——评审重点、抽样比例、对 AI 意见的采信度——都需要重校。</p>\n<p><strong>AI 采用冲击稳定性。</strong> DORA 2024 报告发现：AI 采用显著提升个体生产力、心流与工作满意度，同时<strong>负向影响交付稳定性与吞吐</strong>，并强调小批量与健壮测试等基本功依然关键（<a href=\"https://dora.dev/research/2024/dora-report/\">dora.dev/research/2024</a>）。稳定性承压意味着门禁面对的负载在变大，而门禁本身往往还是旧的。</p>\n<p><strong>能力边界在漂移。</strong> c-CRAB 基准测得现有评审 agent 合计只能解决约四成任务，被测对象包括开源 PR-agent 与 Devin、Claude Code、Codex 等商业 agent（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.23448\">arXiv:2603.23448</a>）。这个边界随每次模型发布移动：为上一代模型设置的门禁强度，对新模型可能过严（白白消耗人时），也可能过松（制造虚假安心）。</p>\n<p>三股力量叠加出一种可以称为<strong>校准债</strong>的东西：门禁参数是按某个时点的缺陷分布与工具能力标定的，环境移动之后债务逐月累积——平时不可见，兑现在逃逸事故上。识别校准债的线索往往先于事故出现：AI 评审意见采纳率连续下滑、同类缺陷反复由人工而非门禁率先发现、团队开始为特定检查维护越来越长的豁免名单。这些迹象出现时，问题已不在某一道具体的门，而在整套体系与现实的距离——这正是需要演进、而非打补丁的信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用什么信号驱动演进\">用什么信号驱动演进</h2><p>演进不该拍脑袋，该由可观测信号驱动：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>它诊断什么</th>\n<th>典型动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>逃逸缺陷（线上 bug 可追溯到已合入 PR）</td>\n<td>评审重点或门禁覆盖缺口</td>\n<td>为该类缺陷补针对性检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>门禁 flaky / 高误报</td>\n<td>门禁失信，团队学会「重跑到绿」</td>\n<td>修复、隔离或删除该检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI 评审意见量大质低</td>\n<td>缺规格接地或指令失焦</td>\n<td>接入规格、收紧指令、降音量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PR 周期持续变长</td>\n<td>冗余或过严的门禁叠加</td>\n<td>合并同类门、下调采样率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>approve 耗时趋近于零</td>\n<td>评审形式化</td>\n<td>抽查评论质量，重构评审分工</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两个可直接落地的度量：门禁逃逸率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>prod</mtext></msub><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>prod</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>caught</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e=\\frac{D_{\\text{prod}}}{D_{\\text{prod}}+D_{\\text{caught}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5395em;vertical-align:-0.5481em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9914em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prod</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">caught</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5131em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prod</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衡量拦截面质量；flaky 率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>flake</mtext></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>run</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f=\\frac{N_{\\text{flake}}}{N_{\\text{run}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3393em;vertical-align:-0.4451em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8942em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">run</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4159em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">flake</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4451em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衡量信度（工程上常见经验阈值是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 超过 1% 后团队开始系统性无视红灯——此值取自通行约定，仅作起点参考）。度量本身也要演进：102 万 PR 的研究提醒我们「评审更快」不等于「评审更好」，速度指标单独存在时会诱导整个体系朝错误方向优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在演进中守住质量\">在演进中守住质量</h2><p><strong>小步、单点、带观察窗。</strong> Google 工程实践文档解释了小改动为何被审得更快也更彻底：评审者更容易用碎片时间完成，也更容易推断影响面（<a href=\"https://google.github.io/eng-practices/review/developer/small-cls.html\">google.github.io/eng-practices</a>）。同样的逻辑适用于门禁变更：一次只动一道门，留两周观察窗，确认指标方向后再继续——大爆炸式改革无法归因，也就无法学习。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    S[&quot;采集信号: 逃逸 / flaky / 周期 / approve 耗时&quot;] --&gt; H[&quot;形成假设: 哪道门失灵&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; A[&quot;单点调整: 加 / 修 / 删一道门&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; O[&quot;观察窗: 两周度量&quot;]&#10;    O --&gt;|&quot;指标改善&quot;| K[&quot;固化: 写入规范&quot;]&#10;    O --&gt;|&quot;无改善或恶化&quot;| R[&quot;回退&quot;]&#10;    K -.-&gt; S&#10;    R -.-&gt; S\">flowchart LR\n    S[\"采集信号: 逃逸 / flaky / 周期 / approve 耗时\"] --&gt; H[\"形成假设: 哪道门失灵\"]\n    H --&gt; A[\"单点调整: 加 / 修 / 删一道门\"]\n    A --&gt; O[\"观察窗: 两周度量\"]\n    O --&gt;|\"指标改善\"| K[\"固化: 写入规范\"]\n    O --&gt;|\"无改善或恶化\"| R[\"回退\"]\n    K -.-&gt; S\n    R -.-&gt; S</pre><p><strong>加减并重。</strong> 演进的引力天然偏向加法——每次事故之后加一道门——但没有减法的门禁体系会膨胀成没人真正阅读的清单。健康的约定是：每份加门提案必须同时回答「哪道旧门因此退役或降级」。加法买安全，减法保信噪比，缺一半都是失衡。</p>\n<p><strong>把协调交给机制。</strong> GitHub 的 merge queue 把「多人竞相合入导致 main 反复损坏、大家互相回滚」的人肉协调自动化成排队批量验证（<a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/configuring-branches-and-merges-in-your-repository/configuring-pull-request-merges/managing-a-merge-queue\">docs.github.com: merge queue</a>）。机制化演进的方向判断标准很简单：凡是人肉协调频繁出错的地方，优先考虑交给机制，把人的注意力留给真正需要判断的部分。</p>\n<p><strong>不变的底线。</strong> 方法可以全换，三条不变：人对结果负最终责任；关键门禁强制执行，「紧急情况手动跳过」不允许常态化；评审守住实质理解而非盖章。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践要点\">实践要点</h2><ul>\n<li>季度门禁审计会：列出每道门的触发次数、失败率与历史捕获贡献，零捕获高摩擦的门当场讨论去留。</li>\n<li>每次线上事故追加一问「哪道门本该拦住它」，答案要么是一道新检查，要么是一份书面接受的已知风险——不允许无结论收场。</li>\n<li>门禁变更走与代码相同的 PR 流程，描述中写明预期改变的指标与观察窗时长。</li>\n<li>每年用固定 PR 集重测 AI 评审工具，刷新「哪些检查层可以放心委托给 AI」的内部清单。</li>\n<li>新流程先在一个服务试点一个观察窗再推广，用试点数据代替全员会议上的直觉辩论。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"../quality-gates-and-automation/layered-quality-gates\">分层的质量门禁</a> 演进的直接对象：那篇列出的四种门禁死法正是校准债的兑现形态。</p>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"../review-in-the-ai-era/what-ai-review-can-and-cannot-do\">AI 评审能做什么不能做什么</a> c-CRAB 的四成解题率是移动快照——能力边界漂移是演进的第一驱动力。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>门禁与评审是会衰减的基础设施：模型换代、团队扩张、门禁自身腐烂都在持续制造偏差。用逃逸缺陷、flaky 率、周期与 approve 质量这些真实信号驱动，小步单点地带观察窗迭代，加减并重、机制替代人肉协调——方法常新，而人对结果负责、关键门禁强制、评审守实质这三条底线不动。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"演进评审与门禁","id":"演进评审与门禁"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么要演进","id":"为什么要演进"},{"level":2,"text":"用什么信号驱动演进","id":"用什么信号驱动演进"},{"level":2,"text":"在演进中守住质量","id":"在演进中守住质量"},{"level":2,"text":"实践要点","id":"实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"保持人的最终问责","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-assisted-code-review-quality/sustaining-quality-with-ai/keeping-humans-accountable"},"next":null}